<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Guangshen Railway suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Guangshen Railway suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the H-shares of Guangshen Railway Co Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.125 lower at HK$3.575 on Friday.</p>
<p>Guangshen Railway operates the sole railroad between the southern Chinese cities of Guangzhou and Shenzhen and participates in train services to Hong Kong.</p>
<p>H-shares are shares of Chinese enterprises listed in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
